            "Table~\\ref{tab:wmt-da-20} shows the segment level Kendall's Tau correlation for all the  language pairs. Results for the best-performing model are shown in bold. All our models outperform the baselines. On the X-to-English language pairs, our best-performing model, \\modelname-XXL, outperforms the nearest supervised baseline \\textsc{OpenKIWI-XLMR} by 4.4 points on average. On the English-to-X language pairs,\n",
